      uses:
        "EP-15 is most often used to patch concrete holes, cracks, divots and non-moving joints. It can also be used when a feathered edge is required for smooth transitions between differing planes. EP-15 kit will cover approximately 3.2 sq. ft. at 1/4\" or 150 LF of 1/4\" X 1/4\" joint.",
